<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets China Overseas warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets China Overseas warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it has issued 550 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Overseas Land and Investment Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$4.095	PREMIUM	    16.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.12194    GEARING	    3.73X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.MAR.98     PAYDATE	    07.APR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$4.55	 LISTING DATE     09.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG     MIN EXER LOT     20,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>		     DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
